From 81fccb937a186b1e0da384802981851b79f0eb4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AxelGalvez11 <axelgalvez1121@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 22:34:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(nemesis): Library tab closes its Obsidian gaps
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Audited against help.obsidian.md; live-preview/wikilinks/backlinks core was
already right. Added:
- [[ autocomplete popup over vault titles (fires only inside [[, preserves
  |alias tails) — wikilink-autocomplete.ts, 12 tests.
- List auto-continuation (Enter continues -, 1., - [ ]; empty marker clears;
  Backspace strips markers) — 7 tests.
- Interactive task checkboxes, ~~strikethrough~~, fenced-code styling in
  live preview (note-decorations.ts, consolidated 14-test smoke file).
- Unresolved wikilinks render muted/dashed; clicking (editor or rail pill)
  creates + opens the note — links.ts, 18 tests.
- Rename + delete for notes/folders (context menus + header icons, IPC):
  rename rewrites [[Old]]/[[Old|alias]]/[[Old#h]]/[[dir/Old]] across the
  vault (exact-title only), remaps open tabs/nav history, force-flushes
  pending autosave first; delete cancels pending autosave — nav-remap.ts,
  rename-dialog.tsx, 9 tests.
- Global sidebar search: filename instant + body text debounced with first
  matching line, title hits ranked first — search.ts, 8 tests.
- Inline images: ![alt](relative) resolves against the note folder,
  ![[image.png]] by filename vault-wide, capped 100% width, unresolvable
  stays plain text — image-embed.ts, 15 tests.

Authored by a subagent; 99/99 library tests green, tsc clean. Integration
wiring hand-reviewed + smoke-tested in the dev app before release.
